    <string name="data_storage">Marandu ñongatu</string>
    <string name="data_storage_intro">Retro Player oñongatu umi app ñemboheko peteĩ marandu ñongatuha michĩvape, upe tendapegua. Ne purahéi ha ne purahéi atykuéra opyta kuatiarogue jepiguáicha, karpétape nde reiporavóvape.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_app_data_title">Aplicación marandu ñongatuha</string>
    <string name="data_storage_app_data_body">Rysýi: %1$s\nTape: %2$s\n\nÑongatu purahéi aty rapo, jehecha reko, ñembopu jey, myatyrõha, ta\'anga\'ita ha ñe\'ẽ jeporavorã.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_library_title">Purahéi marandurenda</string>
    <string name="data_storage_library_body">Umi marandu ñe\'ẽngue araka\'eve ndojekopiai pe app maranduñongatuhápe. Emoĩ umi vore arandukakoty pegua ha Retro Player omoñe\'ẽta umi marandu aranduka guive voi.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_playlists_title">Purahéi aty kuatiakuéra</string>
    <string name="data_storage_playlists_body">Umi purahéi aty ha\'e kuatiarogue .m3u reínte oñeñongatúva ne arandukakoty karpetakuérape. Ikatu emoambue ko app-pe térã oimeraẽ kuatiarogue moambueha rupive.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_platform_title">Tenda: %1$s</string>
    <string name="data_storage_android_permissions_title">Android jeheja ha ñongatuha</string>
    <string name="data_storage_android_native_body">Retro Player oñongatu idatokuéra ñongatuha app-pegua vore ñemiguápe, ñongatuha pypeguápe. Ne purahéi marandurenda opyta karpetakuérape reiporavóva pe sistema karpeta poravoha rupive.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_android_playback_title">Android ñembopu tapykuépe</string>
    <string name="data_storage_android_playback_body">Oñehendúramo pu, Retro Player omoñepyrũ peteĩ tembiapo media tenondegua, upéicha rupi ñehendu osigue embotýramo nde pumbyry térã emoambuévo app-kuéra, ha umi mbohapeha oĩ sistema momaranduhápe. Embohasáramo pe app \"Umi Ojeipurúva Ramoite\"-gui, omopã ñehendu ha oipe\'a pe momarandu.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_platform_body_android">Aplicación marandu oñeñongatu pe tenda pytyvõrã ha\'eñóvape, ñongatuha pypeguápe.</string>
